    TCP diagnostics, reports, bookmarks, retention, and configurable alerts.
  * Add passive monitor-mode Wi-Fi access-point and client observation.
  * Add Wireshark-style safe display filters and saved one-click presets.
  * Add a signed GitHub Pages APT-repository publishing workflow.

